@startuml hmi-editor-live
!theme plain
title HMI Builder named Live operation (specification 39 section 11)
component "Builder Design / Live" as editor
component "LiveOperating\nShared runtime display" as display
component "LiveDisplayHost\nRequests and stream messages" as adapter
component "LiveOperator\nSaved/deployed bundle gate" as host
component "LiveSession\nTarget pin + host-only cookie" as session
component "Live network\nHTTP + WebSocket, no redirects" as network
component "Selected runtime\nHMI session + roles + command service" as runtime
component "Hmi.Display\nProgram task + command outcomes" as plc
artifact "Named-user audit log" as audit
component "Static Build presentation\nLabels, units and placeholders" as samples
editor --> samples : Design mode only
samples --> editor : shared drawing; no live process values
editor --> display : Run target source
display --> adapter : shared login, confirmations, reads, commands
adapter <--> host : scoped webview messages
host --> session : allowed HMI routes
session --> network : transport access + named cookie
network <--> runtime : authenticated HTTP and value stream
runtime <--> plc : existing HMI exchange
runtime --> audit : actor + command + outcome
editor --> host : end on exit or source change
host --> session : end on edit, target change or disconnect
note bottom of session
No token or cookie in project files.
No arbitrary URLs, deploy or control proxy.
No command replay after disconnect.
end note
@enduml
